        {
          "text": "na Oveti‐etomu, vamwe na ana‐a‐ĩthe moo, mĩongo thanthatũ na nyanya; o na Oveti‐etomu mwana wa Yetuthuni na Osa methĩwe asũvĩi ma mĩomonĩ; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.38",
